# Theme and CSS

- Theme colors/fonts live as CSS variables on `:root` / `[data-theme]` in `styles/global.css`.
- In components, use `var(--…)` — do not hardcode palette hex/rgb outside `global.css`.
- Theme switching is `data-theme="dark"|"light"` on the document element.
- Component styles use CSS Modules (`index.module.css`) colocated with the component.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` via the global no-op `fade-up` keyframes; do not reintroduce `!important` animation overrides.
